  "title": "Conviction vs. Condemnation",
  "headline": "Conviction or Condemnation: How to Tell the Difference",
  "headline_sub": "Why God’s Voice Leads You Home While Shame Drives You Away",
  "tagline": "Conviction identifies what needs to change. Condemnation attacks who you are.",
  "seo_title": "Conviction vs. Condemnation: How to Tell the Difference (Romans 8:1) | TheWrkShop",
  "seo_description": "Conviction says what you did was wrong; condemnation says you are what's wrong. A devotional for men on Romans 8:1, shame and godly sorrow.",
  "keywords": [
